  "summary": "The United Nations officially began on 24 October 1945, once China, France, the Soviet Union, the United Kingdom, the United States and a majority of the other signatories had ratified its Charter. The Charter was signed on 26 June 1945 in San Francisco by 50 countries; Poland signed later, making 51 founding members. It works for international peace and security, human rights and international law.",
